.TH INSTALL.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-cluster-tools 1.0.1" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
install.sh \- per-user install of ssh\-selector and lan\-scan with launchers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./install.sh
.br
.B ./install.sh \-\-uninstall
.br
.B ./install.sh \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
Finds the first of
.BR python3 ,
.BR python3.12 ,
.BR python3.11 ,
.BR python3.10 ,
.BR python3.9 ,
.B python
on
.B PATH
that is 3.9 or newer; creates or updates a venv in
.BR $INSTALL_DIR/venv ;
installs this checkout into it; copies
.I config/hosts.yaml.example
to
.IR $INSTALL_DIR/config/ ;
and writes two launcher scripts,
.B $APP_CMD
and
.BR lan\-scan ,
into the first existing of
.I ~/.local/bin
and
.I ~/bin
(creating
.I ~/.local/bin
if neither exists).
Existing launchers of those names are overwritten.
It warns when that directory is not on
.BR PATH .
.PP
None of the topology files is installed, and
.BR ssh\-selector (1)
looks for host files only in the current directory and its
.IR config/ ,
so the installed command needs
.B \-c
or a directory that holds the YAML.
.SH OPTIONS
Only the first argument is examined.
Any other value, including a mistyped option, performs a normal install.
.TP
.B \-\-uninstall
Run
.B rm \-rf
on
.B $INSTALL_DIR
and remove
.B $APP_CMD
and
.B lan\-scan
from both
.I ~/.local/bin
and
.IR ~/bin ,
whoever wrote them.
No confirmation.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print
.B mu2edaq\-cluster\-tools
.I version
(from
.IR ssh_selector.py )
and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B INSTALL_DIR
Install directory.
Default
.IR ~/.local/share/mu2edaq\-cluster\-tools .
The name is generic: a value inherited from another tool's environment is
used as is, and
.B \-\-uninstall
deletes it recursively.
.TP
.B APP_CMD
Name of the
.B ssh\-selector
launcher.
Default
.BR ssh\-selector .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $INSTALL_DIR/venv/
Private virtual environment.
.TP
.I $INSTALL_DIR/config/hosts.yaml.example
Annotated example.
.TP
.IR ~/.local/bin/ssh\-selector ", " ~/.local/bin/lan\-scan
Launchers that
.B exec
the venv's entry points.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success, including an uninstall that found nothing.
.TP
.B 1
No Python 3.9+, or any failing step
.RB ( "set \-e" ).
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
\&./install.sh
ssh\-selector \-c ~/Git/mu2edaq\-cluster\-tools/config/mu2e_daq.yaml
\&./install.sh \-\-uninstall
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bootstrap.sh (1),
.BR ssh\-selector (1),
.BR lan\-scan (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Andrew Norman, Mu2e DAQ Group, Fermi National Accelerator Laboratory.
